; The one variable: an icon whose drawn size is zero in one axis. Left: `expand_icon` with no text on a Button
; sized to its own margins, so the room is exactly zero. Right: a 100x1 icon clamped by
; `icon_max_width = 1` to 1x0, beside the text. Godot reserves the icon's size and the separation either
; way (button.cpp:349-405). unit-button-expand-icon-no-room has the negative size.

